      <abstract>
        <sec id="abs1"><title>Background</title><p>Hypertension is common and often untreated.</p></sec>
        <sec id="abs2"><title>Methods</title><p>We randomly assigned 238 adults to Drug A or placebo.</p></sec>
      </abstract>
      <kwd-group><kwd>hypertension</kwd><kwd>randomized controlled trial</kwd></kwd-group>
